# private/: read as a KOF user, it holds non-public series and pre-release
# vintages. Never commit it, whatever is decided about public/.
private/

# public/: released public series only. Kept out of git until KOF's terms for
# republishing public series in this public repository are confirmed; then
# delete this line (see kof/README.md and the issue).
public/

# Stray output of the first run, which was started inside kof/ before the
# output path was resolved from the script's location.
kof/

# An R session started in this folder writes its command history here, and a
# session that set up KOF credentials would carry them in it. Never publish it.
.Rhistory
.RData
